ant>|<changedPublicField>' . --glob '*.ts' --glob '*.js' --glob '*.md'`.\n- Matrix axes: list every independent input axis and the required rows before implementation.\n- Algorithm invariant: for path/redaction/parser/resolver/security fixes, state the invariant and adversarial cases.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:affected-surfaces -->\n\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:phases -->\n## 4. IMPLEMENTATION PHASES\n<!-- FILL: Point to `tasks.md` and name the three phases in one line. GOOD: Setup reads the current output. Implementation adds the branch. Verification counts lines. WEAK: See tasks. -->\n\nFollow the ordered tasks in `tasks.md`. It owns the Setup, Implementation and Verification phase checkboxes and task state.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:phases -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:testing -->\n## 5. TESTING STRATEGY\n<!-- FILL: Name the one command you will run and the output it must print. GOOD: `--quiet` prints 1 line. The default prints 17. WEAK: Test it manually. -->\n\n| Test Type | Scope | Tools |\n|-----------|-------|-------|\n| Unit | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Components/functions] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Jest/pytest/etc.] |\n| Integration | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: API endpoints/flows] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Tools] |\n| Manual | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: User journeys] | Browser |\n<!-- /ANCHOR:testing -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:dependencies -->\n## 6. DEPENDENCIES\n<!-- FILL: List each tool the change needs, or write `None`. GOOD: `bash` and `awk`. No new package. WEAK: Usual dependencies. -->\n\n| Dependency | Type | Status | Impact if Blocked |\n|------------|------|--------|-------------------|\n| [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: System/Library] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Internal/External] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Green/Yellow/Red] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Impact] |\n<!-- /ANCHOR:dependencies -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:rollback -->\n## 7. ROLLBACK PLAN\n<!-- FILL: Name the trigger and the one command that reverts the change. GOOD: Trigger: the default output changes. Revert the one commit. WEAK: Roll back if needed. -->\n\n- **Trigger**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: 