{"toolCallId":"call_97fd37c5a990437b8216b93cfad5af39","title":"Ran bash","kind":"execute","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"resource","resource":{"mimeType":"text/x-shellscript","text":"bash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/create.sh --skip-branch --level 3 --track zz-bench-authoring --short-name recommend-level-quiet-flag \"Add a quiet flag to recommend-level.sh\"","uri":"tool://preview"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/preview_is_shell_command":true}}}],"rawInput":{"command":"bash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/create.sh --skip-branch --level 3 --track zz-bench-authoring --short-name recommend-level-quiet-flag \"Add a quiet flag to recommend-level.sh\"","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/223-deepseek-final"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/commandNames":["bash"],"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
